{
 "_doc": "Per-stage tool profiles for jobs/dispatch.py (JOBS-CONTRACT.md). tools = the allowlist (Bash only through allow rules); writes = the agent's lane: [path regex, fields ('*' = whole doc), options?]. Options: {\"create\": true} = create-only (a set on an existing doc is refused). {k} = the request's project key. A write outside its lane is dropped at collect (jobs/runs/<job>/dropped.json + decisions/lane-<job>), never applied. pageOwned = fields the owner's page owns inside docs an agent lane may write; collect strips them from every agent write. Paths in common are relative to the repo root.",
 "common": {
  "addDirs": [
   "."
  ],
  "cwd": ".",
  "model": "sonnet",
  "allow": [
   "Bash(python3:*)",
   "Bash(date:*)"
  ]
 },
